<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Embodied Intelligence & Physical AI Lecture 2: Paradigm Evolution from VLA to World Models" description="In our June 20 lecture, we introduced the core concepts of Embodied Intelligence and Physical AI. This second lecture will focus on the evolution of technical paradigms..." path="/en/posts/2026-07-10-embodied-intelligence-physical-ai-second-lecture/">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
