          【Free Public Lecture | Zoom】Embodied Intelligence & Physical AI Lecture 2: Paradigm Evolution from VLA to World Models
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-4 flex items-center gap-x-2">
          <span>Speaker: 刘斌 (Bin Liu)</span>
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="text-slate-300 space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white pt-2">Silicon Valley Quantum AI Lab Public Charity Lecture</h3>
        <h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-blue-400">Embodied Intelligence & Physical AI Lecture 2: Paradigm Evolution from VLA to World Models</h4>
        
        <div class="bg-blue-950/40 border border-blue-900/30 rounded-2xl p-5 my-6 text-slate-300 space-y-3 shadow-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-x-2 text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
            <span>Lecture Concluded & Recording Available</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
            This lecture was successfully held on July 18, 2026. Recording and strategic resource materials are now available for download:
          </p>
          <div class="text-xs space-y-2 pt-1 border-t border-slate-900">
            <p>
              🎥 <strong>Watch Recording (YouTube)</strong>:
              <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLFLjZG5qNpyg" target="_blank" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline font-semibold transition-colors">
                Watch YouTube playlist recording
              </a>
            </p>
            <p>
              📚 <strong>Lecture Slides & Strategic Materials</strong>:
              <a href="https://nacuaa.ai" target="_blank" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline font-semibold transition-colors">
                Download slides and strategic PDFs on AI Club
              </a>
              or
              <a href="https://zju.fyi/en/workshops/" target="_blank" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline font-semibold transition-colors">
                Download on ZJU.FYI
